{"title":"Pod Salts","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"pod-salt-classic-tobacco","title":"POD SALT - Classic Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis Classic Tobacco Nicotine Salt e-liquid by Pod Salt provides the most authentic tobacco flavour e-liquid in a nicotine salt format .Our premium quality Nicotine Salt blend is absorbed faster and offers a more intense level of satisfaction that traditional nicotine e-liquids.The Pod Salt Core range is ESMA Compliant and manufactured with British-made e-liquid.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779569207,"sku":"POD S - Classic Tobacco 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779601975,"sku":"POD S - Classic Tobacco 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-classic-tobacco.jpg?v=1749916753"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-blueberry-mist","title":"POD SALT - Blueberry Mist","description":"The Pod Salt Core range offers a premium selection of British-made flavours. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salt to produce a perfectly smooth and effective vaping experience. Designed to taste delicious. Designed to Hit the Spot.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779634743,"sku":"POD S - Blueberry Mist 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779667511,"sku":"POD S - Blueberry Mist 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-blueberry-mist.jpg?v=1749916755"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-cuban-creme","title":"POD SALT - Cuban Creme","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/pod-salts\"\u003ePOD SALT\u003c\/a\u003e Cuban Crème range offers a premium selection of British-made flavours. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salt to produce a perfectly smooth and effective vaping experience. Designed to taste delicious. Designed to Hit the Spot.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779700279,"sku":"POD S - Cuban Creme 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"25mg\/ml (2.5% Nicotine)","offer_id":41711004418103,"sku":"POD S - Cuban Creme 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779733047,"sku":"POD S - Cuban Creme 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-cuban-creme.jpg?v=1749916757"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-double-apple","title":"POD SALT - Double Apple","description":"Take a trip to the tropics with our mango ice flavour destined to become your next favourite vape. Mellow, sweet and refreshing with a dash of ice. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salt formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779765815,"sku":"POD S - Double Apple 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41711067070519,"sku":"POD S - Double Apple 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779798583,"sku":"POD S - Double Apple 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-double-apple.jpg?v=1749916759"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-mango-ice","title":"POD SALT - Mango Ice","description":"Take a trip to the tropics with our mango ice flavour destined to become your next favourite vape. Mellow, sweet and refreshing with a dash of ice. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salt formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779831351,"sku":"POD S - Mango Ice 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779864119,"sku":"POD S - Mango Ice 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-mango-ice.jpg?v=1749916761"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-mixed-berries-ice","title":"POD SALT - Mixed Berries Ice","description":"A berry-delightful blend of forest fruits including strawberry, raspberry and blueberry, finishing with a cooling ice breeze. Delightfully sweet, tangy and fresh. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salts formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779896887,"sku":"POD S - Mixed Berries Ice 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779929655,"sku":"POD S - Mixed Berries Ice 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-mixed-berries-ice.jpg?v=1749916764"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-banana-ice","title":"POD SALT - Banana Ice","description":"Get the pick of the bunch with our deliciously sweet and creamy banana flavour, topped with a fresh icy twist. Smooth and refreshing. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salts formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\/30mg\/50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708779962423,"sku":"POD S - Banana Ice 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"30mg\/ml ( 3% Nicotine)","offer_id":41708779995191,"sku":"POD S - Banana Ice 30 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780027959,"sku":"POD S - Banana Ice 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-banana-ice.jpg?v=1749916766"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-blue-raspberry","title":"POD SALT - Blue Raspberry","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur candy inspired Blue Raspberry flavour will have your tastebuds tingling from the deliciously sweet and sour notes. Tangy and bursting with berry goodness. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salts formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/pod-salts\" title=\"Pod nic salt\"\u003ePod nic salt\u003c\/a\u003e experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780060727,"sku":"POD S - Blue Raspberry 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780093495,"sku":"POD S - Blue Raspberry 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-blue-raspberry.jpg?v=1749916768"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-lychee-ice","title":"POD SALT - Lychee Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe took refreshing lychee fruit and gave it a cool, icy twist. A fragrant delicacy from tropical Southeast Asia, this light but sweet lychee blend works wonders with the fresh, ice finish. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salts formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg (Image only for display)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780126263,"sku":"POD S - Lychee 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780159031,"sku":"POD S - Lychee 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-lychee-ice.jpg?v=1749916769"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-pachamama-strawberry-kiwi-ice","title":"POD SALT - Pacha Mama Strawberry Kiwi Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eA fruity blend of ripe strawberries and tropical kiwi finished with a smooth, icy exhale. A magical earthiness lives deep in this all-day vaping experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInspired by the Incan Goddess, Pacha Mama represents all the goodness of Mother Nature. Her influence extends beyond the Andes and into your senses as you enjoy this original and refreshing E-liquid. The sweet fragrance of ripe strawberry blends beautifully with tropical kiwi notes, bringing you an essence of spring that will heighten your senses.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780191799,"sku":"POD S - Pacha Mama Strawberry Kiwi Ice 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"25mg\/ml (2.5% Nicotine","offer_id":41710998290487,"sku":"POD S - Pacha Mama Strawberry Kiwi Ice 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780224567,"sku":"POD S - Pacha Mama Strawberry Kiwi Ice 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-pacha-mama-strawberry-kiwi-ice.jpg?v=1749916771"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-ice-menthol","title":"POD SALT - Ice Menthol","description":"This combination of refreshing, juicy watermelon with an icy breeze makes for a cool and mouth-watering experience. A light, revitalizing sweet treat to vape. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salts formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine Strength: 25mg (Image only for display)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780257335,"sku":"POD S - Ice Menthol 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780290103,"sku":"POD S - Ice Menthol 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-ice-menthol.jpg?v=1749916773"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-watermelon-breeze","title":"POD SALT - Watermelon Breeze","description":"This combination of refreshing, juicy watermelon with an icy breeze makes for a cool and mouth-watering experience. A light, revitalizing sweet treat to vape. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salts formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780322871,"sku":"POD S - Watermelon Breeze 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41711013167159,"sku":"POD S - Watermelon Breeze 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780355639,"sku":"POD S - Watermelon Breeze 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-watermelon-breeze.jpg?v=1749916775"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-cola-lime","title":"POD SALT - Cola Lime","description":"A timeless classic from Big Tasty. Tasty cola is piqued with a fresh bittersweet lime flavour.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Pod Salt Fusions range is an exclusive E-liquid collaboration project. Pod Salt brings you the world’s biggest brands and blends their signature flavours with our award-winning Nicotine Salt. Designed to taste delicious. Designed to Hit the Spot.\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780388407,"sku":"POD S - Cola Lime 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780421175,"sku":"POD S - Cola Lime 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-cola-lime.jpg?v=1749916778"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-marshmallow-man-iii","title":"POD SALT - Marshmallow Man III","description":"\u003cp\u003eA smooth and creamy blend of fluffy marshmallows and strawberries for an indulgent and fruity vape. Finished with a touch of sweet vanilla. If you like your dessert vapes, you’re going to love Marshmallow Man III.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThis Marshmallow Man III Nicotine Salt E-liquid is a Fusions collaboration by \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/pod-salts\" title=\"Pod Salt\"\u003ePod Salt\u003c\/a\u003e and Marina. An original and exclusive flavour for an all-day vaping experience. In the third instalment of Marina’s Marshmallow Man trilogy, Marshmallow Man III lives up to its name.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Pod Salt Fusions range is an exclusive E-liquid collaboration project. Pod Salt brings you the world’s biggest brands and blends their signature flavours with our award-winning Nicotine Salt. Designed to taste delicious. Designed to Hit the Spot.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780453943,"sku":"POD S - Marshmallow Man III 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780486711,"sku":"POD S - Marshmallow Man III 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-marsh-mallow-man-3.jpg?v=1749916780"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-cigarette","title":"POD SALT - Cigarette","description":"We provide one of the most authentic cigarette tobacco flavours available, perfect for those who struggle to quit smoking and love the warm, robust tastes of tobacco. Full-bodied, warm and smooth. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salts formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour profile: Cigarette\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePod Salt’s advanced Nicotine Salt formula is designed to provide an exceptionally smooth vaping experience at high nicotine strengths. Salts represent an evolutionary step in quality from standard freebase nicotine, offering vapers enhanced nicotine delivery and greater satisfaction. Our formula is engineered for low vapour production, bringing an element of stealth and discretion to your vaping.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780519479,"sku":"POD S - Cigarette 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780552247,"sku":"POD S - Cigarette 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-cigarette.jpg?v=1749916782"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-fresh-mint","title":"POD SALT - Fresh Mint","description":"We’ve combined cool and refreshing mint leaves to create an invigorating vape you can enjoy throughout the day. Make your day minty fresh. Blended with our award-winning Nicotine Salts formula.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavour profile: Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePod Salt’s advanced Nicotine Salt formula is designed to provide an exceptionally smooth vaping experience at high nicotine strengths. Salts represent an evolutionary step in quality from standard freebase nicotine, offering vapers enhanced nicotine delivery and greater satisfaction. Our formula is engineered for low vapour production, bringing an element of stealth and discretion to your vaping.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780617783,"sku":"POD S - Fresh Mint 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780650551,"sku":"POD S - Fresh Mint 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-fresh-mint.jpg?v=1749916784"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-pink-haze","title":"POD SALT - Pink Haze","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePink Haze\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e: Enter a dreamy realm with Ripe strawberries mingle with tangy raspberries, enveloped in a creamy haze. Each puff is a journey through soft clouds of fruity sweetness, leaving you in a blissful state of satisfaction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\/25mg\/50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/pod-salts\" title=\"Pod Salt\"\u003ePod Salt\u003c\/a\u003e experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780683319,"sku":"POD S - Pink Haze 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780716087,"sku":"POD S - Pink Haze 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780748855,"sku":"POD S - Pink Haze 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Pod-salt-Pink-Haze-min.jpg?v=1749916786"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-vanilla","title":"POD SALT - Vanilla","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVanilla\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e: Indulge in the timeless elegance of Vanilla Nicotine Salt E-liquid with rich vanilla bean essence fills the air, wrapping you in a warm embrace of sweet simplicity. Let each inhale transport you to a world of pure indulgence and comfort.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\/25mg\/50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780847159,"sku":"POD S - Vanilla 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine)","offer_id":41708780879927,"sku":"POD S - Vanilla 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780912695,"sku":"POD S - Vanilla 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Pod-salt-vanilla-min.jpg?v=1749916788"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-liquor-tobacco","title":"POD SALT - Liquor Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eLiquor Tobacco\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e: Discover sophistication in every puff of Nic Salt with Aged tobacco leaves blending seamlessly with the warmth of fine liquor notes. Immerse yourself in the refined complexity of this indulgent fusion.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\/25mg\/50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708780945463,"sku":"POD S - Liquor Tobacco 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine)","offer_id":41708780978231,"sku":"POD S - Liquor Tobacco 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708781010999,"sku":"POD S - Liquor Tobacco 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-origin-liquor-tobacco-min.jpg?v=1749916790"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-amnesia-mango","title":"POD SALT - Amnesia Mango","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAmnesia Mango\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e: Lose yourself in tropical paradise with Amnesia Mango Nicotine Salt with Ripe mangoes tantalize your taste buds with their sweet allure, offering a blissful escape to sun-soaked shores with each puff.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand : \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/pod-salts\" title=\"Pod Salt Nicotine Salt\"\u003ePod salt\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\/25mg\/50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708781043767,"sku":"POD S - Amnesia Mango 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine)","offer_id":41708781076535,"sku":"POD S - Amnesia Mango 25 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50mg\/ml ( 5% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708781109303,"sku":"POD S - Amnesia Mango 50 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/pod-salt-fusion-cali-green-amnesia-mango-30ml-min.jpg?v=1749916792"},{"product_id":"pod-salt-fresh-raspberry-mojito","title":"POD SALT - Fresh Raspberry Mojito","description":"\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFresh Raspberry Mojito\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e: Inspired by the classic cocktail, this e-liquid combines the sweet, tart flavor of fresh raspberries with a hint of mint and lime. It offers a refreshing and fruity vaping experience, with a subtle mojito twist that adds an invigorating zest, perfect for those who enjoy cocktail-inspired flavors.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle size: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strength: 20mg\/30mg\/50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRatio: 50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the UK\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTPD Compliant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor the best Pod Salt experience, we recommend MTL style vaping, and any low-wattage device using 10-20 watts with medium to tight draw, 0.8-1.2ohm resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"POD SALT","offers":[{"title":"20mg\/ml ( 2% Nicotine )","offer_id":41708781142071,"sku":"POD S - Fresh Raspberry Mojito 20 mg","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"25mg\/ml ( 2.5% Nicotine)","offer_id":41708781174839,"sku":"POD S - Fresh Raspberry Mojito 25 mg","price":1